{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Right then! Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0has been handed over the Richards-Botham Trophy and he goes on to celebrate with his teammates. That's it we have from this exciting series. But the cricketing action does not stop here. You can switch tabs and enjoy our coverage from\u00a0the Indian T20 League, where Bangalore is taking on Punjab. See you there, folks!", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:08:04+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Joe Root,\u00a0the skipper of England, says that it has been a frustrating Test match, they\u00a0showed a lot of fire in the first innings. Adds that Day 3 was a very frustrating day for them, as they didn't manage it well. Mentions that they\u00a0took a few strides forward in the first two games, but he credits West Indies\u00a0for the way they played this match. Informs that they\u00a0didn't read the surface, as well as they should have. States that there is still a lot of learning that needs to be done. Adds that\u00a0Jack Leach\u00a0has been exceptional and Dan Lawrence\u00a0also showed a lot of promise, which is very exciting. Concludes by thanking all the fans who came out and supported them.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:10:08+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Kraigg Brathwaite, the victorious skipper is also\u00a0the PLAYER OF THE SERIES. He says that it feels fantastic to win the series and he thanks all the fans for coming to the stadium and supporting them. Adds that he has been working hard and it is pleasing that he is getting rewards now. Tells that everyone has chipped in at some point and it has been a total team effort. Applauds all his teammates by saying that they have been brilliant.\u00a0He adds that they had a camp before the series and they ensured that they practiced hard and were aware that this was going to be an important series for them. Tells that the young players in the side are willing to learn and players like Joshua Da Silva, Jayden Seales,\u00a0and Alzarri Joseph\u00a0have done really well in this Test series. Mentions that they want to build on this performance and they cannot afford to relax going forward. Says that all the players will need to stay hungry and prepare well for their next series.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:09:07+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Joshua Da Silva\u00a0is the PLAYER OF THE MATCH. He\u00a0says that he has dreamt of getting a hundred and he is very happy with his performance. Adds that all the credit goes to his batting partners and it was because of them that he was able to get his hundred. Tells that keeping wickets on this track was a challenge and he will take a lot of learnings from this series. Mentions that he will look to improve and keep getting better game-by-game.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:07:04+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "Stay tuned for the presentation...", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:52:14+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "England\u00a0tried their best, fought hard, but failed in the end. They struggled while batting in both the innings. Their top-order and middle-order\u00a0failed to score runs, and had it not been for their lower-order,\u00a0England\u00a0would have not reached their respectable total of 204\u00a0in the first innings. Their bowlers did a fine job at the beginning, but they\u00a0let West Indies\u00a0get away at the end, and coming to bowl for the second time, they had very little to fight for. A disappointing tour for them, but still a few positives to take from this tour. Jack Leach\u00a0finished\u00a0with 11 wickets in this series, Ben Stokes also displayed his skills in this series.\u00a0 However, before this tour, they made a bold decision of leaving out Stuart Broad and James Anderson, and that might have hurt them in hindsight. Nevertheless, a lot to think about for England.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:11:44+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "We witnessed a run-fest in the previous two Test matches, but this time things were a bit different. West Indies bowlers were right on cue. They displayed their magic in the first innings by dismissing England for 204\u00a0runs and they did the same thing in the third innings as well. They made sure that England do not get away with a healthy lead and they bundled\u00a0out England for 120, the second time. Kyle Mayers\u00a0was the leader of the pack, he grabbed his maiden five-wicket haul and demolished England's batting line-up. Not to forget\u00a0Joshua Da Silva's maiden Test hundred which helped West Indies\u00a0get to 297 while batting. All in all, it's been a sensational performance from the hosts and they have come out on top eventually.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:11:43+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Bowler_Name": "", "Batsman": "", "Batsman_Name": "", "Batsman_Style": "", "Commentary": "West Indies win, and they win in an emphatic style! The Richards-Botham trophy will stay with West Indies. After two hard-fought draws, we finally get a result in this match. West Indies\u00a0have given a lot to cheer about to their fans at Grenada. While England have now lost yet another Test series. A lot to ponder for them now.\u00a0The players of West Indies take a lap of honor to acknowledge the fans that have cheered them from the stands.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T16:12:19+00:00", "Non_Striker": "", "Non_Striker_Name": "", "Score": "", "Batsman_Runs": "", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,335,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Woakes", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "There it is! West Indies\u00a0seal the match as well as the series. It is the skipper who hits the winning runs! This was a good-length ball, around middle. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0tucks it wide of the mid on fielder and comes back for the second run. West Indies\u00a0win the final Test by 10 wickets!", "Summary": {"Score": "28/0", "Over": "4.5", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "7858", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "20", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "60160", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "8", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "4321", "Overs": "2.5", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0", "Ball_bowled": "17", "Dot_balls": "10"}], "Balls": "29"}, "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:29:07+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "28/0", "Batsman_Runs": "2", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "2", "Ball_Speed": "129.0kph", "Ball_Number": "29", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "6,246,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Woakes", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Full and outside off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0pushes it towards the mid off fielder.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:28:11+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "26/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "133.0kph", "Ball_Number": "28", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "5,200,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Woakes", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Back of a length, around off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0keeps it out.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:27:36+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "26/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "27", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,221,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Woakes", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! Nicely timed! This is full and outside off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0leans and drives it past the mid off fielder for a boundary. West Indies\u00a0need just 2 runs now.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:26:46+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "26/0", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "132.0kph", "Ball_Number": "26", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "b", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Woakes", "Batsman": "60160", "Batsman_Name": "John Campbell", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Bye! A wayward ball, angling down leg. John Campbell\u00a0misses his flick and Ben Foakes\u00a0behind the sticks half-stops it. The batters steal a bye.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:26:19+00:00", "Non_Striker": "7858", "Non_Striker_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Score": "22/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Extras_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "25", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "5,189,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64948", "Bowler_Name": "Saqib Mahmood", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Back of a length, outside off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0hangs back and taps it towards backward point.", "Summary": {"Score": "21/0", "Over": "4", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "7858", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "14", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "60160", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64948", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0", "Ball_bowled": "12", "Dot_balls": "8"}], "Balls": "24"}, "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:25:10+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "21/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "134.0kph", "Ball_Number": "24", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64948", "Bowler_Name": "Saqib Mahmood", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "That stayed low! A length ball, outside off and staying a touch low. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0looks to poke at it but the ball sneaks through his bat and goes towards the keeper.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:24:26+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "21/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "23", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64948", "Bowler_Name": "Saqib Mahmood", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Back of a length, well outside off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0looks to cut but he misses.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:23:48+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "21/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "22", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "6,238,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64948", "Bowler_Name": "Saqib Mahmood", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "Pitches it up, outside off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0drives it to the mid off fielder.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:23:41+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "21/0", "Batsman_Runs": "0", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "0", "Ball_Speed": "136.0kph", "Ball_Number": "21", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,185,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64948", "Bowler_Name": "Saqib Mahmood", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! SMASHED! Back-to-back boundaries! The skipper looks in a hurry to finish things off! Short of a length, outside off. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0stays back and cuts it past the point fielder for another boundary.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:22:41+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "21/0", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "132.0kph", "Ball_Number": "20", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,3,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64948", "Bowler_Name": "Saqib Mahmood", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite", "Batsman_Style": "R", "Commentary": "FOUR! Easy pickings! A full ball, around middle and leg. Kraigg Brathwaite\u00a0flicks it through the mid-wicket region for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2022-03-27T15:22:10+00:00", "Non_Striker": "60160", "Non_Striker_Name": "John Campbell", "Score": "17/0", "Batsman_Runs": "4", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "4", "Ball_Speed": "134.0kph", "Ball_Number": "19", "Day": "4", "Session": "1", "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,193,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "4321", "Bowler_Name": "Chris Woakes", "Batsman": "7858", "Batsman_Name": "Kraigg Brathwaite"